 {
  "key": "c0.4.0",
  "parent": "c0.4",
  "html": "<section class=\"nps-section chapter ch-arrival\" id=\"arrival\" data-chapter=\"0\" data-chapter-name=\"Arrival\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"arr-bg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"nps-img-2\" id=\"arrBg\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a60bdc0340e5f1784b4d553/6a75f6f5b1410d1e317165c0_interior.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"arr-bg-after-nps\"></div></div><div class=\"nps-div-2 wrap arr-in\"><div class=\"mpd-box\"><p class=\"nps-p chapter-tag\" data-anim=\"hide\"><i class=\"nps-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 00 \u00b7 Arrival</span></p><h1 class=\"nps-h1\" id=\"arrTitle\" data-anim=\"hide\">Your first visit, <em class=\"nps-em\">properly done.</em></h1><p class=\"nps-p-2 lead\" id=\"arrLead\" data-anim=\"hide\"> A comprehensive exam, x-rays, a cleaning and a full treatment plan \u2014 everything needed to know exactly where your teeth stand, in a single appointment. </p><div class=\"price-block\" id=\"arrPrice\" data-anim=\"hide\"><div class=\"price-now\" data-count-to=\"189\">$189</div><div class=\"price-meta\"><span class=\"price-save\">Save $328</span> <span class=\"mpd-box price-was\">Regular $517<div class=\"price-was-after\"></div></span></div><p class=\"nps-p-3 fine\"> New patients of Mason Park Dental of Katy. Any further treatment is quoted for your approval before anything is started. </p></div><ul class=\"nps-ul chips-nps\" id=\"arrChips\" data-anim=\"hide\"><li class=\"chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tick nps-emb-1 nps-emb-2 tick\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>Comprehensive exam</li><li class=\"chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tick nps-emb-1 nps-emb-2 tick\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>X-rays</li><li class=\"chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tick nps-emb-1 nps-emb-2 tick\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>Cleaning</li><li class=\"chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tick nps-emb-1 nps-emb-2 tick\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>Full treatment plan</li></ul><div class=\"nps-div-3 rating\" data-anim=\"hide\"><span class=\"stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"score\">5.0</span> <span class=\"src\">rated by our patients on Google</span></div><div class=\"nps-div-4 arr-cue\" data-anim=\"hide\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Begin</span><i class=\"nps-i-3\"></i></div></div><div class=\"form-card\" id=\"book\" data-anim=\"hide\"><div class=\"form-head\"><p class=\"nps-p eyebrow\">Claim the special</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Book your first visit</h2><p class=\"nps-p small muted\">Two quick steps. We will confirm your time by phone.</p></div><div data-embed-slot=\"0\"></div></div></div></section>",
  "split": false
 },
 {
  "key": "c0.4.1",
  "parent": "c0.4",
  "html": "<section class=\"nps-section-2 chapter ch-catch\" id=\"catch\" data-chapter=\"1\" data-chapter-name=\"The Catch\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"catch-pin\" id=\"catchPin\"><div class=\"mpd-box wrap\"><p class=\"nps-p chapter-tag\"><i class=\"nps-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 01 \u00b7 The Catch</span></p><p class=\"catch-statement\" id=\"catchStatement\"> Plenty of practices advertise a cheap first visit, then charge separately for the x-rays that make it useful. </p><div class=\"catch-after\" id=\"catchAfter\"><p class=\"nps-p-4\">This is the whole appointment, in one price. The exam, the imaging, the cleaning and a written plan \u2014 not a loss-leader that turns into a quote at the desk.</p><p class=\"nps-p-4\">You leave knowing exactly where your teeth stand and exactly what anything further would cost, before a single thing is started.</p></div><div class=\"catch-meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"nps-i-4\" id=\"catchMeter\"></i></div></div></div></section>",
  "split": false
 },
 {
  "key": "c0.4.2",
  "parent": "c0.4",
  "html": "<section class=\"nps-section-2 chapter ch-covers\" id=\"covers\" data-chapter=\"2\" data-chapter-name=\"What It Covers\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"cov-pin\" id=\"covPin\"><div class=\"nps-div-5 wrap cov-grid\"><div class=\"mpd-box\"><p class=\"nps-p chapter-tag\"><i class=\"nps-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 02 \u00b7 What It Covers</span></p><h2 class=\"nps-h2\">A full picture, not a quick look.</h2><p class=\"nps-p-5 lead\"> Everything below is included in the one fee. Keep scrolling and watch it come off. </p><div class=\"cov-list\" id=\"covList\"><div class=\"nps-div-6 cov-item\"><span class=\"nps-span-4 cov-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"nps-emb-3 nps-svg-2\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"nps-emb-4\" d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"nps-strong\">Comprehensive exam</strong> \u2014 a full assessment of teeth, gums and bite, including an oral cancer screening.</span></div><div class=\"nps-div-6 cov-item\"><span class=\"nps-span-4 cov-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"nps-emb-3 nps-svg-2\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"nps-emb-4\" d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"nps-strong\">X-rays</strong> \u2014 digital, so you see what we see, with a fraction of the radiation of film.</span></div><div class=\"nps-div-6 cov-item\"><span class=\"nps-span-4 cov-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"nps-emb-3 nps-svg-2\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"nps-emb-4\" d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"nps-strong\">Cleaning</strong> \u2014 a professional clean to finish the visit.</span></div><div class=\"nps-div-7 cov-item\"><span class=\"nps-span-4 cov-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"nps-emb-3 nps-svg-2\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"nps-emb-4\" d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"nps-strong\">Full treatment plan</strong> \u2014 written, itemised and priced, so nothing arrives as a surprise later.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mpd-box\"><div class=\"ledger\"><p class=\"nps-p label\">Your first visit</p><p class=\"ledger-figure\" id=\"covFigure\">$517</p><p class=\"ledger-state\" id=\"covState\">Regular value</p><div class=\"ledger-rail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"nps-i-5\" id=\"covRail\"></i></div><div class=\"ledger-saving\"><span class=\"mpd-box small muted\">You save</span> <b class=\"nps-b-2\" id=\"covSaving\">$0</b></div><p class=\"nps-p-6 fine\"> Available to new patients of Mason Park Dental of Katy. Additional services, where clinically required, are quoted for your approval before treatment begins. </p></div><div class=\"nps-div-8 btn-row\"><a class=\"nps-a-4 btn btn--sand btn--lg magnetic\" href=\"#book\"><div class=\"btn-before\"></div><span class=\"nps-span-3\">Claim the $189 special</span></a></div></div></div></div></section>",
  "split": false
 },
 {
  "key": "c0.4.3",
  "parent": "c0.4",
  "html": "<section class=\"nps-section-2 chapter ch-visit\" id=\"visit\" data-chapter=\"3\" data-chapter-name=\"The Visit\" data-theme=\"dark\"><div class=\"cov-pin\" id=\"visPin\"><div class=\"mpd-box wrap\"><p class=\"nps-p chapter-tag\"><i class=\"nps-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 03 \u00b7 The Visit</span></p><h2 class=\"nps-h2\">What actually happens on the day.</h2><div class=\"vis-track\"><div class=\"vis-spine\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"nps-i-6\" id=\"visSpine\"></i></div><div class=\"vis-steps\" id=\"visSteps\"><div class=\"vis-step\"><span class=\"nps-span-5 vis-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><div class=\"mpd-box\"><h3 class=\"nps-h3\">We look properly</h3><p class=\"nps-p-7\">A comprehensive exam and digital x-rays, using cone beam imaging and an intra-oral camera so you can see what we are describing.</p></div></div><div class=\"vis-step\"><span class=\"nps-span-5 vis-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><div class=\"mpd-box\"><h3 class=\"nps-h3\">We explain what we found</h3><p class=\"nps-p-7\">Your oral health needs, goals and priorities are the focus of your customised treatment plan \u2014 written down, itemised and priced.</p></div></div><div class=\"vis-step\"><span class=\"nps-span-5 vis-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><div class=\"mpd-box\"><h3 class=\"nps-h3\">You decide what happens next</h3><p class=\"nps-p-7\">Nothing beyond the cleaning is started on the day. You leave with the plan and the costs, and choose in your own time.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>",
  "split": false
 },
 {
  "key": "c0.4.4",
  "parent": "c0.4",
  "html": "<section class=\"nps-section-2 chapter ch-team\" id=\"team\" data-chapter=\"4\" data-chapter-name=\"The Team\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"mpd-box wrap chapter-body\"><div class=\"mpd-box head-block head-block--center\"><p class=\"nps-p-8 chapter-tag\"><i class=\"nps-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 04 \u00b7 The Team</span></p><h2 class=\"nps-h2\">Who you will be seeing.</h2><p class=\"nps-p-9 lead\"> Dr. Sung, Dr. Cho and Dr. Nguyen are committed to providing excellent dentistry in a comfortable environment. We welcome new patients of all ages. </p></div><div class=\"team\" id=\"teamGrid\"><figure class=\"nps-figure\"><div class=\"nps-div-9 doc-photo\"><img class=\"nps-img-3\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a60bdc0340e5f1784b4d553/6a75f6f477131cf728cb0074_dr-cho.jpg\" alt=\"Dr. Dave Cho\" width=\"683\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption class=\"mpd-box\"><p class=\"name\">Dr. Dave Cho</p><p class=\"role\">General Dentist</p></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"nps-figure\"><div class=\"nps-div-9 doc-photo\"><img class=\"nps-img-3\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a60bdc0340e5f1784b4d553/6a75f6f59d16ef209fb2def2_dr-sung.webp\" alt=\"Dr. William Sung, DMD\" width=\"230\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption class=\"mpd-box\"><p class=\"name\">Dr. William Sung, DMD</p><p class=\"role\">General Dentist</p></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"nps-figure\"><div class=\"nps-div-9 doc-photo\"><img class=\"nps-img-3\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a60bdc0340e5f1784b4d553/6a75f6f5f4fd87d5da081957_dr-nguyen.jpg\" alt=\"Dr. Tam Nguyen\" width=\"683\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption class=\"mpd-box\"><p class=\"name\">Dr. Tam Nguyen</p><p class=\"role\">Board Certified Pediatric Dentist</p></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"offers\"><div class=\"offers-head\"><h3 class=\"nps-h3-2\">Other new-patient offers</h3><p class=\"nps-p muted\">Mention these when you book and we will apply them to your visit.</p></div><div class=\"nps-div-10 grid\" id=\"offerGrid\"><article class=\"tile\"><p class=\"num\">$129</p><h3 class=\"nps-h3-3\">New patient exam for children</h3><p class=\"nps-p-10\">For children under 13, seen by Dr. Tam Nguyen, our board certified pediatric dentist.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><p class=\"num\">$350</p><h3 class=\"nps-h3-3\">New patient whitening</h3><p class=\"nps-p-10\">KOR<sup>\u00ae</sup> whitening with at-home trays, at the new-patient rate.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><p class=\"num\">Free</p><h3 class=\"nps-h3-3\">Second opinion</h3><p class=\"nps-p-10\">Confused about a treatment plan, or unsure about an opinion you have been given? See a doctor you can trust, at no cost.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><p class=\"num\">Free</p><h3 class=\"nps-h3-3\">Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup> consultation</h3><p class=\"nps-p-10\">Complimentary clear-aligner consultation, with $1,000 off treatment currently available.</p></article></div></div></div></section>",
  "split": false
 },
 {
  "key": "c0.4.5",
  "parent": "c0.4",
  "html": "<section class=\"nps-section-2 chapter ch-proof\" id=\"proof\" data-chapter=\"5\" data-chapter-name=\"The Proof\" data-theme=\"dark\"><div class=\"mpd-box wrap chapter-body\"><div class=\"mpd-box proof-head head-block head-block--center\"><p class=\"nps-p-8 chapter-tag\"><i class=\"nps-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 05 \u00b7 The Proof</span></p><h2 class=\"nps-h2\">What our patients say afterwards.</h2><div class=\"proof-score\"><span class=\"stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"18\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"18\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"18\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"18\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"18\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg></span> <b class=\"nps-b-3\" id=\"proofScore\">5.0</b> <span class=\"nps-span-6 small\">rated by our patients on Google</span></div></div><div class=\"nps-div-11 grid grid--3\" id=\"proofGrid\"><figure class=\"review\"><span class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"15\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"15\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"15\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"15\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"15\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"15\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"15\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"15\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"15\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"15\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg></span><blockquote class=\"nps-blockquote\">\u201cVery friendly staff and were willing to help in every way! Felt more comfortable here than at any other dentist office in the past, highly recommend!\u201d</blockquote><figcaption class=\"nps-figcaption\"><span class=\"nps-strong\">Gabriel Sanchez</span> <span class=\"src\">Google review</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"g-mark nps-emb-1 nps-emb-5 g-mark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M23 12.3c0-.8-.1-1.6-.2-2.3H12v4.5h6.2a5.3 5.3 0 0 1-2.3 3.5v2.9h3.7c2.2-2 3.4-5 3.4-8.6z\" fill=\"#4285F4\"></path><path d=\"M12 23.5c3.1 0 5.7-1 7.6-2.8l-3.7-2.9c-1 .7-2.3 1.1-3.9 1.1-3 0-5.5-2-6.4-4.7H1.8v3a11.5 11.5 0 0 0 10.2 6.3z\" fill=\"#34A853\"></path><path d=\"M5.6 14.2a6.9 6.9 0 0 1 0-4.4v-3H1.8a11.5 11.5 0 0 0 0 10.4z\" fill=\"#FBBC05\"></path><path d=\"M12 5.1c1.7 0 3.2.6 4.4 1.7l3.3-3.3A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 1.8 6.8l3.8 3a6.9 6.9 0 0 1 6.4-4.7z\" fill=\"#EA4335\"></path></svg></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><span class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><svg class=\"nps-emb-1 nps-svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"curr