  "html": "<section class=\"nps-section-2 chapter ch-invitation\" id=\"invitation\" data-chapter=\"6\" data-chapter-name=\"The Invitation\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"mpd-box wrap chapter-body\"><p class=\"nps-p chapter-tag\"><i class=\"nps-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 06 \u00b7 The Invitation</span></p><div class=\"mpd-box split inv-pay\"><div class=\"nps-div-12 split-media inv-fig\" id=\"invFig\"><img class=\"nps-img-5\" id=\"invFigImg\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a60bdc0340e5f1784b4d553/6a75f6f5f905c0e9996d7fff_office.webp\" alt=\"The treatment area at Mason Park Dental of Katy\" width=\"1536\" height=\"658\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"mpd-box\"><h2 class=\"nps-h2\" id=\"invPayTitle\">Insurance-friendly, with a plan for everyone else.</h2><p class=\"nps-p-5 lead\"> We are an insurance-friendly office with financing options, and our team will help verify what your plan covers before you commit to treatment. </p><div class=\"nps-div-8 card card--warm\"><img class=\"nps-img-6\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a60bdc0340e5f1784b4d553/6a75f6f46a20fa8ba8dabad3_cherry.svg\" alt=\"Cherry\" width=\"110\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3 class=\"nps-h3-3\">0% APR, no hard credit check</h3><p class=\"nps-p-12 muted\"> Buy now, pay monthly. Let your money go further and take better control of your finances when you pay in instalments with Cherry financing. </p></div><p class=\"nps-p-5 fine\"> A dental savings plan is also available for patients without insurance. Ask the front desk when you book. </p></div></div><div class=\"inv-services\"><div class=\"mpd-box head-block head-block--center\"><p class=\"nps-p eyebrow\">Comprehensive care</p><h2 class=\"nps-h2-2\">One practice for the whole family.</h2><p class=\"nps-p-9 lead\"> For your convenience we provide a wide range of dental solutions in our local Katy location, for patients of all ages. </p></div><ul class=\"nps-ul-2 chips-nps\" id=\"invChips\"><li class=\"chip\">Preventative dentistry</li><li class=\"chip\">Cosmetic dentistry</li><li class=\"chip\">Restorative dentistry</li><li class=\"chip\">Pediatric dental care</li><li class=\"chip\">Dental implants</li><li class=\"chip\">Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup></li><li class=\"chip\">Root canal therapy</li><li class=\"chip\">Oral surgery &amp; extractions</li><li class=\"chip\">Emergency dentistry</li><li class=\"chip\">Sedation dentistry</li><li class=\"chip\">Laser dentistry</li><li class=\"chip\">TMJ / TMD</li><li class=\"chip\">Dentures &amp; bridges</li><li class=\"chip\">Oral cancer screening</li></ul><p class=\"nps-p-13 fine\"> Our technology includes cone beam imaging, digital x-rays, an intra-oral camera and a soft tissue laser. Flexible scheduling and same-day emergency care are available. </p></div><div class=\"inv-close\" id=\"invClose\"><div class=\"mpd-box\"><p class=\"nps-p-14 eyebrow\">New patient special</p><h2 class=\"nps-h2-3\" id=\"invCloseTitle\">$189 for the visit that tells you everything.</h2><p class=\"nps-p-15\">Exam, x-rays, cleaning and a full written treatment plan \u2014 a saving of $328. We welcome new patients of all ages.</p></div><div class=\"mpd-box btn-row\"><a class=\"nps-a-5 btn btn--lg magnetic\" href=\"#book\"><div class=\"btn-before\"></div><span class=\"nps-span-3\">Claim the special</span></a> <a class=\"nps-a-6 btn btn--ghost btn--lg\" href=\"tel:+12817698878\" data-phone=\"href\"><div class=\"btn-before\"></div> Call <span class=\"nps-span-3\" data-phone-text=\"\">(281) 769-8878</span></a></div></div></div></section>",
  "split": false
 },
 {
