  "html": "<footer class=\"site-foot\"><div class=\"mpd-box wrap\"><div class=\"foot-grid\"><div class=\"mpd-box\"><div class=\"nps-div-13 brand\"><img class=\"nps-img-7\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a60bdc0340e5f1784b4d553/6a75f6f55de88305f0932586_logo.webp\" alt=\"Mason Park Dental of Katy\" width=\"180\" height=\"69\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p class=\"nps-p small\">We are located at the corner of Mason Rd and Kingsland Blvd, behind the Ranch 99 complex.</p></div><div class=\"mpd-box\"><h3 class=\"nps-h3-4\">Visit</h3><p class=\"nps-p\">21830 Kingsland Blvd #104A<span class=\"br-line\">Katy, TX 77450</span></p><p class=\"nps-p-16\"><a class=\"nps-a-7\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/21830+Kingsland+Blvd+%23104a,+Katy,+TX+77450/@29.775949,-95.7512199,17z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get directions</a></p></div><div class=\"mpd-box\"><h3 class=\"nps-h3-4\">Call</h3><p class=\"nps-p\"><a class=\"nps-a-8\" href=\"tel:+12817698878\" data-phone=\"href\"><span class=\"mpd-box\" data-phone-text=\"\">(281) 769-8878</span></a></p><p class=\"nps-p-16 small\"><a class=\"nps-a-7\" href=\"https://www.flexbook.me/masonpark/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Schedule online</a></p></div><div class=\"mpd-box\"><h3 class=\"nps-h3-4\">Hours</h3><ul class=\"nps-ul-3 hours-list small\"><li class=\"nps-li\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Monday</span><span class=\"mpd-box\">9am \u2013 6pm</span></li><li class=\"nps-li\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Tuesday</span><span class=\"mpd-box\">8am \u2013 5pm</span></li><li class=\"nps-li\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Wednesday</span><span class=\"mpd-box\">9am \u2013 6pm</span></li><li class=\"nps-li\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Thursday</span><span class=\"mpd-box\">8am \u2013 5pm</span></li><li class=\"nps-li\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Fri \u2013 Sun</span><span class=\"nps-span-6\">Closed</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"foot-base\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">\u00a9 2026 Mason Park Dental of Katy. All rights reserved.</span> <span class=\"mpd-box\">KOR<sup>\u00ae</sup> is a registered trademark of Evolve Dental Technologies, Inc. Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup> is a registered trademark of Align Technology, Inc.</span></div><p class=\"nps-p-6 fine\"> Offer terms: the $189 New Patient Special covers a comprehensive exam, x-rays, a cleaning and a full treatment plan, a saving of $328 against a regular value of $517. Available to new patients of Mason Park Dental of Katy. The $129 children's exam applies to children under 13. Additional services, where clinically required, are quoted for your approval before treatment begins. </p></div></footer>",
